            {
                "entry_id": "ff11acb0-55c4-3e86-8145-c114cff86f2b",
                "word": "nikotynizm",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32f64ac0-679c-3aa4-aaa7-0c4776511b32",
                        "entry_id": "ff11acb0-55c4-3e86-8145-c114cff86f2b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "nałóg palenia lub, rzadziej, żucia tytoniu"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f239139-0ff2-4f42-ab36-6f2627154766",
                                "sense_id": "32f64ac0-679c-3aa4-aaa7-0c4776511b32",
                                "text": "Dodatkowo styl życia znacznej grupy badanych (nikotynizm, niski poziom aktywności fizycznej, spożywanie alkoholu) znacząco odbiegał od zaleceń profilaktyki zdrowotnej"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7b8b063-6d46-43e4-9715-333c6121dc2a",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff11acb0-55c4-3e86-8145-c114cff86f2b",
                        "source_sense_id": "32f64ac0-679c-3aa4-aaa7-0c4776511b32",
                        "target_lang_word": "nicotinism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nicotinism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af9aaef2-96bf-3704-bc81-13940be0db9d",
                                        "entry_id": "56b9df26-b468-3403-87ec-f78b4e735720",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nicotine poisoning (especially as a result of tobacco use)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c459c367-2be1-4f6e-94ea-5520f1ae3316",
                                                "sense_id": "af9aaef2-96bf-3704-bc81-13940be0db9d",
                                                "text": "Some authors, among them Taylor, and Woodman and Tidy hold that it is dilated in acute poisoning, while Pereira and Bartholow, say contracted, but in chronic nicotinism it is usually dilated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe4470ec-0cb2-442a-ab9b-f5cdeb5a78e3",
                                                "sense_id": "af9aaef2-96bf-3704-bc81-13940be0db9d",
                                                "text": "Chronic nicotinism is usually experienced by those who smoke cigars, and by cigarmakers who are continually handling tobacco."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ec41063-6b94-469f-85f1-45f66e34b679",
                                                "sense_id": "af9aaef2-96bf-3704-bc81-13940be0db9d",
                                                "text": "\"Nicotinism,\" poisoning by nicotine, is characterized by stimulation and subsequent depression of the central and autonomic nervous systems."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d138443e-c8ad-3456-87c6-2d46b1b898dd",
                                        "entry_id": "56b9df26-b468-3403-87ec-f78b4e735720",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Addiction to nicotine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8807fde7-bbae-469e-b5d4-d0ee75042e31",
                                                "sense_id": "d138443e-c8ad-3456-87c6-2d46b1b898dd",
                                                "text": "Of the means of relief adopted for the cure of nicotinism, abandonment of the cause will bring about recovery in most cases without any medication"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "010bc646-7fa9-44d0-9065-3590621b8235",
                                                "sense_id": "d138443e-c8ad-3456-87c6-2d46b1b898dd",
                                                "text": "The grandeur intoxication prompts the customary good natured obtrusion of the practice of nicotinism in to the presence of others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6f267d9-216d-4ada-9e2d-d19b8d0e8eaa",
                                                "sense_id": "d138443e-c8ad-3456-87c6-2d46b1b898dd",
                                                "text": "The common genetic background to nicotinism and alcoholism could involve a number of neurotransmitter systems in the brain, since both drugs have a rich pharmacology."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d04e66ea-69f1-4371-bcf9-fc887343f58f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff11acb0-55c4-3e86-8145-c114cff86f2b",
                        "source_sense_id": "32f64ac0-679c-3aa4-aaa7-0c4776511b32",
                        "target_lang_word": "nicotinisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nicotinisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7e7c25f-ae0b-33e1-ba89-3d1379ce729a",
                                        "entry_id": "15067fb0-7b24-3d6b-92ab-acec2fbd3fbd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tabagisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "310c12fa-802a-4266-9e9d-e45a8897ed89",
                                                "sense_id": "d7e7c25f-ae0b-33e1-ba89-3d1379ce729a",
                                                "text": "Dès l’entrée, Segré sentit cette odeur caractéristique des cafés de quartiers, mélange de bières, d’encaustique et tabac que des années de nicotinisme avaient imprégnée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "217a511d-8b97-4ef1-a828-650ae544972f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ff11acb0-55c4-3e86-8145-c114cff86f2b",
                        "source_sense_id": "32f64ac0-679c-3aa4-aaa7-0c4776511b32",
                        "target_lang_word": "tabagisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tabagisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b923f6d-5074-3c9c-996f-362666edf227",
                                        "entry_id": "a949c308-12b5-38a0-84b6-3925bdb7914d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intoxication et dépendance provoquées par le tabac."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38eea855-4ba8-44d6-82aa-d4fdde9bdec6",
                                                "sense_id": "7b923f6d-5074-3c9c-996f-362666edf227",
                                                "text": "Le tabagisme se situe bien loin devant l’alcoolisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da09ba07-84a0-415d-b76c-588da7aa15c6",
                                                "sense_id": "7b923f6d-5074-3c9c-996f-362666edf227",
                                                "text": "La toxicologie du tabagisme comporte, comme celle de l’alcoolisme, des aspects psycho-comportementaux et psycho-sociaux, avec une importante composante passive, des manifestations physiologiques et cliniques et des implications neuro-psychologiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc594f55-d69a-4926-8eee-70ba8e60ade6",
                                                "sense_id": "7b923f6d-5074-3c9c-996f-362666edf227",
                                                "text": "Vocalement, je suis au meilleur de mes possibilités, à l’époque j’ai encore deux poumons. Parce que dans quelques mois, on va m’en enlever un pour cause de tabagisme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1988daa0-4305-36e1-bb5c-af0ede4b4c56",
                                        "entry_id": "a949c308-12b5-38a0-84b6-3925bdb7914d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Consommation de tabac."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9f174d9-daa4-44c2-b51d-e96e4cbd5b3b",
                                                "sense_id": "1988daa0-4305-36e1-bb5c-af0ede4b4c56",
                                                "text": "Le tabagisme est également très répandu, avec 47 % de fumeurs réguliers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44a91be0-c4af-46e9-9e31-6d272e9de92f",
                                                "sense_id": "1988daa0-4305-36e1-bb5c-af0ede4b4c56",
                                                "text": "Le Canada n’a pas de loi fédérale pour restreindre le tabagisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9de24ab8-e804-40ad-a3d9-570fb3000634",
                                                "sense_id": "1988daa0-4305-36e1-bb5c-af0ede4b4c56",
                                                "text": "Ils ont interdit le tabagisme en public."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c242b384-553a-433b-b90c-240b455b4bda",
                                                "sense_id": "1988daa0-4305-36e1-bb5c-af0ede4b4c56",
                                                "text": "Le tabagisme passif est à l’origine de très nombreuses morts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
